5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am worried the floor might crack under the weight of the new pieces.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The record of past attendance matters more than the floor. I want to see what actually drew people back.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I want to know who is actually standing in the room. The staff list looks old, but who is really doing the work?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I keep getting stuck on delivery. I want to see where past seasons actually came unstuck, not where they were meant to.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I am curious where the money actually goes. I want to see the invoices that quietly swallow the budget before the season ends.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I am still thinking about the floor. I will check the structural survey of the suspended bay.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the five years of visitor comment slips. The words tell us what they valued.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I will check the conservation lab staffing and backlog. I also want to see the volunteer roster to know who is actually there.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I will check the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs. I also want to see the loan transport costs over three seasons.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I will check the mount-making charges and joiner's rate. I also want to see the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I am a bit nervous about asking, but I hope the survey will show if the bay is safe.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, the floor is a constraint, not the story. I am waiting to see if the comments match the attendance figures.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, I agree. But if the staff are gone, the story doesn't matter. I am checking who is actually left to do the work.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, that is a fair point. If the people are gone, the delivery fails. I am hoping the paperwork shows where the delays actually happened.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, delays are expensive. I am hoping the maintenance logs reveal which displays quietly drain the budget every season.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I will also look at the weekend head counts. I need to know if the room is already full before we add more weight.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"I will also check the weekend head counts. Attendance patterns reveal what the public actually returns for, not what we intended.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I will also check the evening hire bookings. If the room is busy at night, we need more people to watch it.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I will also check the weekend head counts. If the room is packed, any delivery hiccup becomes a public disaster.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I will also check the evening hire bookings. If the gallery is rented out, the maintenance costs for those displays will spike unexpectedly.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
